<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <title>eFac - Authentification</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ asset('tmplog/images/icons/favicon.ico') }}"/>
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/fonts/font-awesome-4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/fonts/Linearicons-Free-v1.0.0/icon-font.min.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/animate/animate.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/css-hamburgers/hamburgers.min.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/animsition/css/animsition.min.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/select2/select2.min.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/daterangepicker/daterangepicker.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/css/util.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="{{ asset('tmplog/css/main.css') }}">

    <style>
        /* Positionnement de l'icône œil à droite du champ */
        .wrap-input100 {
            position: relative !important;
        }

        .password-icon {
            position: absolute !important;
            right: 15px !important;
            top: 50% !important;
            transform: translateY(-50%) !important;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 10;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .password-icon svg {
            width: 20px !important;
            height: 20px !important;
            color: #999;
            transition: color 0.2s;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .password-icon svg:hover {
            color: #333;
        }

        /* Espace à droite pour que le texte ne chevauche pas l'icône */
        #password {
            padding-right: 45px !important;
        }

        /* Suppression de l'œil natif du navigateur (Chrome, Edge, Safari) */
        input[type="password"]::-ms-reveal,
        input[type="password"]::-ms-clear,
        input[type="password"]::-webkit-contacts-auto-fill-button,
        input[type="password"]::-webkit-credentials-auto-fill-button,
        input[type="password"]::-webkit-textfield-decoration-container {
            display: none !important;
            visibility: hidden !important;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="background-color: #666666;">

<div class="limiter">
    <div class="container-login100">
        <div class="wrap-login100">

            <form action="{{ checkPathUrl ? checkPathUrl: path(checkPathRoute) }}" method="post" class="login100-form validate-form">


                <span class="login100-form-title p-b-43">Authentification à deux facteurs</span><br />

                <span class="p-b-43">
                    <b>Veuillez saisir le code à 6 chiffres envoyé par mail.</b>
                </span><br />

                {# <p class="label"><label for="_auth_code">{{ "auth_code"|trans({}, 'SchebTwoFactorBundle') }} {{ twoFactorProvider }}:</label></p>  #}

                {% if authenticationError %}
                    <div class="txtError"><strong>{{ authenticationError|trans(authenticationErrorData, 'SchebTwoFactorBundle') }}</strong></div>
                {% endif %}

                <div class="widget wrap-input100">
                    <input
                            id="_auth_code"
                            type="text"
                            class="input100 form-control"
                            name="{{ authCodeParameterName }}"
                            autocomplete="one-time-code"
                            autofocus
                            inputmode="numeric"
                            pattern="[0-9]*"
                    />
                    <span class="focus-input100"></span>
                    <span class="label-input100">Code</span>
                </div>

                {% if displayTrustedOption %}
                    <br /><div class="widget"><label for="_trusted"><input id="_trusted" type="checkbox" name="{{ trustedParameterName }}" /> {{ "trusted"|trans({}, 'SchebTwoFactorBundle') }}</label></div><br />
                {% endif %}

                {% if isCsrfProtectionEnabled %}
                    <input type="hidden" name="{{ csrfParameterName }}" value="{{ csrf_token(csrfTokenId) }}">
                {% endif %}

                <div class="container-login100-form-btn">
                    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" data-controller="csrf-protection" value="{{ csrf_token('authenticate') }}">
                    <button class="login100-form-btn" type="submit">Valider le code</button>
                </div>

                <br />
                <p class="cancel">
                    <a href="{{ logoutPath }}">
                        <button class="login100-form-btn">{{ "cancel"|trans({}, 'SchebTwoFactorBundle') }}</button>
                    </a>
                </p>

            </form>

            <div class="login100-more" style="background-image: url('{{ asset('tmplog/images/bg-01.jpg') }}');"></div>
            <div style="
                position: absolute;
                top: 50%;
                left: 50%;
                transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
                text-align: center;
                padding: 30px;
                background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
                border-radius: 12px;
                width: 85%;
            ">
                <h1 style="
                    color: #ffffff;
                    font-size: 2rem;
                    font-weight: 900;
                    text-transform: uppercase;
                    letter-spacing: 6px;
                    margin-bottom: 15px;
                    text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
                ">Services et solutions SMS</h1>

                <div style="
                    width: 60px;
                    height: 3px;
                    background: #ffffff;
                    margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
                    border-radius: 2px;
                "></div>

                <p style="
                    color: #f0f0f0;
                    font-size: 1rem;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    margin: 0;
                ">
                    <strong style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.3rem;">
                        Pour vos solutions complètes de messagerie d'entreprise
                    </strong><br><br>

                    Notre service SMS professionnel prend en charge de nombreux cas d'utilisation,
                    garantissant des taux de délivrabilité optimaux.<br />Il intègre également des systèmes de protection
                    contre la fraude à la pointe du secteur,<br />des fonctionnalités de personnalisation et bien plus encore.
                    <br /><br />

                    <strong style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.3rem;">Pour tous les secteurs d'activité</strong><br><br>

                    Des startups technologiques aux grandes entreprises, nous avons appris à relever les défis
                    communs à tous les secteurs.<br />Notre prochain objectif est de vous aider à lancer votre service SMS
                    professionnel en toute simplicité.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/jquery/jquery-3.2.1.min.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/animsition/js/animsition.min.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/bootstrap/js/popper.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/bootstrap/js/bootstrap.min.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/select2/select2.min.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/daterangepicker/moment.min.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/daterangepicker/daterangepicker.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/vendor/countdowntime/countdowntime.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('tmplog/js/main.js') }}"></script>

</body>
</html>